{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：15:00 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉兒子AJ慶祝10歲生日  獲女星肉緊吻賀  圓碌碌極有福氣一部位似老竇係潛力股\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1da8d4807c0f6ac18682dd97cb9d750/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__50.png\"/>\n<p>64歲的歌壇不老男神杜德偉，自2012年與年輕24歲的嬌妻李曉冰（Ice）結婚後，育有一名兒子AJ。杜德偉一向視兒子為命根，轉眼間，精靈可愛的AJ已經迎來10歲生日，日前杜德偉夫婦與圈中好友上山詩納一同為AJ舉辦了溫馨的生日會，上山詩納隨後於社交平台分享合照，相中可見AJ長得肉嘟嘟、面圓圓，眉眼間與爸爸杜德偉如同倒模一樣，非常溫馨有愛，亦有網民指AJ圓碌碌極得意，未來絕對是靚仔潛力股。</p>\n<h2>杜德偉兒子AJ暴風式成長</h2>\n<p>從上山詩納分享的相片中可見，當天眾人特意準備了精緻的朱古力忌廉生日蛋糕，牌子上寫着「Happy Birthday my dear AJ」。壽星仔AJ身穿藍白色的棒球T恤，面對鏡頭展露燦爛而略帶靦腆的笑容，顯得十分乖巧。疼愛AJ的上山詩納更熱情地攬實他，並在AJ粉嫩的臉頰上深情地「錫咗一啖」，畫面極具溫馨感。</p>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉的囝囝AJ，跟父親成個餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fae8964619b7af3547524d9eb8ae3e97/2023-07/AJ1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉一向最愛聖誕節，曾一家三口去芬蘭聖誕老人村。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17868df8a4f3fefc27a3252e710dd76f/2024-12/alexto_dudewei_1703509282_3265595006650215071_1281047469.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉佈置聖誕樹，囝囝則在一旁觀看爸爸大顯身手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab8ff64631047d325963979fdeac13d1/2024-12/alexto_dudewei_1734258741_3523540162066711987_1281047469.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉曾替兒子慶生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/874e956714d135e79d3a5f0895d9275e/2024-12/-5gm31I730NOkL4DQM4Ip5a8Gn8HlOd06-yU6OvslOg.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉與太太Ice及寶貝仔AJ在草地溫馨自拍，一家三口齊齊展露陽光燦爛笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326c80881be8e040d7c8f0e11e6e85e3/2026-11/SaveClip_App_651943449_18129741862540658_1843306952943537884_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疼愛AJ的上山詩納親密地攬實壽星仔，10歲的AJ頂著標誌性的圓潤面珠，十分乖巧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c2ccae55a38e4fd9b79d1e40b1bb32e/2026-11/SaveClip_App_890716470_18644885854021051_3263603985563345653_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"AJ暴風式成長，越大越似爸爸杜德偉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4da5f38cfa7dc996c49b175b0cc4ef6/2026-11/SaveClip_App_890716474_18644885920021051_318007045738616037_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"上山詩納捧著AJ面頰熱情地「錫咗一啖」，受寵若驚的AJ頓時露出靦腆而幸福的笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41ecee7f3381874c86b34647a200094e/2026-11/SaveClip_App_890716657_18644885887021051_2475641245274859729_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉戴上黃色鴨舌帽，與太太Ice、圈中好友上山詩納齊現身，合體為AJ慶祝十歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40d439671e01d45542374b1518146429/2026-11/SaveClip_App_890716917_18644885899021051_418742084630090229_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星仔AJ眼瞇瞇望鏡頭，面前擺放着特意準備、插上單支蠟燭的精緻忌廉生日蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e8a2eb19a5601c3a74ffc1a653a4787/2026-11/SaveClip_App_890717041_18644885902021051_1925829599136311436_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"後方有一條連着二樓的雲石樓梯，豪華之中又不失格調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af125a8ce5e2f7453ce487313f8fb1e8/2024-12/gvL_34Ya25P7Tovt4sd3vwCdFd8qZnc1WMSAcVjEgHE.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉一家身處的單位十分寬敞，巨型客廳之中除放着一張按摩椅外，還擺放不少字畫、古董。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/358d7c2ca2b695e53ef5d6a2485017a6/2024-12/HhCff6ZH1QUY-MsqAsrMOMpBtMHbs424Yn4pTmJ-KU4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉與老婆Ice育有一子AJ。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd5bf6aa07ae4a045a1ad42828dfd30b/2022-09/%E6%9D%9C%E5%BE%B7%E5%81%89%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%20%285%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉的囝囝相當可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f203f7d1b3f155112b67c8493084adcd/2022-09/%E6%9D%9C%E5%BE%B7%E5%81%89%E8%80%81%E5%A9%86%20%286%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉因工作並非常在家中，每次見到囝囝都表現好熱情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e155192e80d8b35899b2f002c82dfd4c/2023-09/1de28e40-ca81-4432-b7e1-863f333caa0f.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉與囝囝玩水，仲見到AJ甩了兩隻牙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/230469c809657cc6c54bf6c3d0b878ab/2023-09/ALEX_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉與囝囝互動充滿溫情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70c251f8c180de4584d5c8af800f84a6/2023-09/ALEX_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"囝囝AJ錫錫，杜德偉冧晒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09cb39bbb24c1cb7bbd20ef018388a6f/2023-09/ALEX_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉兩父子共浴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba018ce52cf36a4cb04640ff6bdf6067/2023-09/ALEX_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉囝囝都幾靚仔，似足爸爸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6550151fdcbd1ba92c68a56b7f6a0262/2026-02/2620476577056388566_1281047469.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉一家三口玩雪。共享天倫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6579b1d723c5e17d9171ca74b5e4ad0/2026-02/3265595006641919795_1281047469.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉甚為愛錫囝囝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c6a2ec991e2ffa308a864207e35f884/2026-02/3655415090557891378_1281047469.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>網民讚AJ神複製杜德偉</h2>\n<p>事實上，杜德偉對這位「心肝寶貝」一直呵護備至，雖然平日工作忙碌，但只要一有時間就會化身「全職爸爸」陪伴兒子成長。AJ如今十歲，生得健康活潑、體型健碩，杜德偉夫婦功不可沒。AJ如今長大成陽光小男孩，網民紛紛送上祝福，大讚AJ越長越有福氣，更直言他與爸爸一樣充滿陽光活力。</p>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉早前在紐約康州舉行演唱會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e69c50e452129abb7e30b95c7c33c47/2026-02/1c321671-6e24-468f-89a8-314f7d46c2e4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉舉行演唱會時，仍未知會遇上暴風雪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99607c9af644b50f05457059ffd265c7/2026-02/07a0c140-b2ee-4cd7-852a-6b2378899ebf.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉新春佳節，飛到紐約開個唱吸金。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75a793a061b2d42c0b5fe807abd5c8f3/2026-02/72fa5a43-a22d-45d5-87d8-016a4f13a813.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉的演唱會甚受歡迎，一票難求。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ae2a1316a8882515cca179a149cdb0b/2026-02/785f5661-b668-4c7f-9b3c-fd009fc696e8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉歌精舞勁，完全不似64歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20547724bed3128b812b22333d1b6cf9/2026-02/90269be1-54e1-407e-bbc5-92f786d1ff40.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉在紐約時代廣場，凍到面青，嘴唇發紫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84703fc974d6119f78256b7d82456c54/2026-02/48eb022c-1c68-4511-9171-d1ad0775a281.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地上有著濕滑積雪，令杜德偉寸步難行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/259404b20b9c8d6c228c370022db4abc/2026-02/86aec669-4a79-406c-809b-df27cc453c61.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"​ 杜德偉身處紐約，大雪覆蓋了汽車的車頂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48b3026d120e924fd04e6481178e40a9/2026-02/2084600a-0bde-42aa-b775-3527b3f90ef2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉四圍白茫茫一片，能見度甚低。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/732e095816306ef6c497b83c548e7e69/2026-02/eb74ee52-4e50-490f-9303-7b8fdaed8178.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"杜德偉肩膀和帽子上全是積雪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/336636efbb0924528fa69a33f16fc0d4/2026-02/ffa3c8a5-3d1e-4867-93e9-7fbde2680bf2.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.216434+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":535,"images":33,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:52.970391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:33.192195+00:00","content_hash":"35850279acb1fc6c5be2279fadb7a1af7431c6b3a03f6e11725cda9d43e2d3d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}